('DEVELOPMENT_QUALITY_CANDIDATE_PENDING_GLOBAL_GATES','Clear historical overview; named Green Revolution and Silent Spring are usable contextual terms without an external exercise or image.','No new confirmed error found in this exact paragraph. The Green Revolution causal account and environmental-movement chronology were not exhaustively verified. Closing political assessment is a historical-edition judgment, not a continuously current fact.','Adjacent native /0/2/4/5 gives incompatible1988/1992 UNFCCC creation dates and a disputed2021 venue already outside this unit; the selected summary reproduces neither detail. Do not inherit those dates or append the defective paragraph.',[]),
('HOLD_WHOLE_SECTION_ATTRIBUTION_NEEDS_REVIEW','Two complete paragraphs identify people, places and dates. No implicit visual/quotation dependency.','Personal authorship phrasing assigns the constitution to Pedro I. The native contextual paragraph adds a select council; Senate institutional history describes commissioned drafting. Distinguish political responsibility/issuing from literal authorship. This is an attribution concern supported by external institutional evidence, not proof Pedro had no input or a source-internal contradiction.','Native para-00022 was additionally read in full: it says he finished writing with a small council. This does not independently verify the summary\'s compressed personal attribution.',['Pedro I wrote a constitution for Brazil']),
('DEVELOPMENT_QUALITY_CANDIDATE_PENDING_GLOBAL_GATES','Brief but coherent conceptual overview; identifies the early Middle Ages and the traditions being combined.','No new confirmed internal error found. The broad feudalism/stability narrative and adjectives crude/effective are interpretive and not independently fact-certified.','The module title should remain source metadata. Nearby Al-Andalus and Roman context helps interpretation but no selected sentence requires a map, recording or omitted antecedent.',[]),
